t","_","_scopeId","_ssrInterpolate","_createTextVNode","_toDisplayString","_ssrRenderList","_createVNode","_component_v_progress_circular","_component_v_row","_component_v_btn","_ssrRenderComponent","_component_v_card_text","_component_v_card_actions","_component_v_img","_component_v_card","_createBlock","_Fragment","_renderList","_component_v_col","_component_v_chip","_component_v_icon"],"sources":["../../../../app/pages/[lang]/favorites.vue"],"sourcesContent":["<script setup lang=\"ts\">\r\n\r\nimport Header1Mobile from \"../../components/editorElements/elements/headers/header1Mobile.vue\";\r\nimport Header1 from \"../../components/editorElements/elements/headers/header1.vue\";\r\nimport Render from \"../../components/editorElements/Render.vue\";\r\nimport type {Row} from \"../../types/EditorTypes\";\r\nimport {ref} from \"vue\";\r\nimport {useRoute} from \"vue-router\";\r\nimport {useDisplay} from 'vuetify'\r\nimport {routeParamString} from \"../../utils/routeParams\";\r\nimport {useTrans} from \"../../../composables/useTrans\";\r\n\r\nconst {t} = useTrans();\r\n\r\nconst route = useRoute()\r\nconst related_pages = ref<{ lang: string; title: string }[]>([])\r\nconst {mdAndUp} = useDisplay()\r\nconst config = useRuntimeConfig()\r\nconst locale = ref<string>(routeParamString(route.params.lang))\r\n\r\nconst {favorites, removeFavorite} = useShopLocal()\r\nconst langParam = computed(() => route.params.lang?.toString() || 'en')\r\nconst isRtl = computed(() => locale.value === 'fa' || locale.value === 'ar')\r\nconst [\r\n  {data: languages},\r\n  {data: footerData},\r\n  {data: header},\r\n  {data: menu}\r\n] = await Promise.all([\r\n  useAsyncData('languages', () => $fetch(`/api/languages`, {baseURL: config.public.baseUrl})),\r\n\r\n  useAsyncData(`footer-${langParam.value}`, () =>\r\n      $fetch<any>(`/api/pages/rows/0-footer-${langParam.value}`, {baseURL: config.public.baseUrl})),\r\n\r\n  useAsyncData<Row[]>(`header-data-${langParam.value}`, () =>\r\n      $fetch(`/api/pages/rows/0-header-${langParam.value}`, {baseURL: config.public.baseUrl}).then((r: any) => r.data || [])),\r\n\r\n  useAsyncData('menu-data', () =>\r\n      $fetch<any>(`/api/menus/get`, {baseURL: config.public.baseUrl}).then(r => r.data || []))\r\n])\r\nuseHead({\r\n  htmlAttrs: {\r\n    lang: () => locale.value,\r\n    dir: () => isRtl.value ? 'rtl' : 'ltr'\r\n  },\r\n  link: () => isRtl.value\r\n      ? [{id: 'rtl-stylesheet', rel: 'stylesheet', href: '/css/rtl.css'}]\r\n      : []\r\n})\r\n</script>\r\n\r\n<template>\r\n  <template v-if=\"languages\">\r\n    <Header1\r\n        v-if=\"mdAndUp\"\r\n        :theme=\"'light'\"\r\n        :header=\"header\"\r\n        :menu=\"menu\"\r\n        :languages=\"languages\"\r\n        :related_pages=\"related_pages\"\r\n        :locale=\"locale\"\r\n    />\r\n    <Header1Mobile\r\n        v-else\r\n        :theme=\"'light'\"\r\n        :rows=\"header\"\r\n        :menu=\"menu\"\r\n        :languages=\"languages\"\r\n        :related_pages=\"related_pages\"\r\n        :locale=\"locale\"\r\n    />\r\n  </template>\r\n  <v-container class=\"shop-page py-12\"\r\n               :style=\"{direction: (isRtl)?'rtl':'ltr'}\">\r\n    <header class=\"d-flex align-end justify-space-between mb-10\">\r\n      <div>\r\n        <h1 class=\"text-h3 font-weight-black mb-1\">{{ t.favorites?.title }}</h1>\r\n        <p class=\"text-body-1 text-medium-emphasis\">{{ t.favorites?.subtitle }}</p>\r\n      </div>\r\n      <v-chip v-if=\"favorites.length\" color=\"primary\" variant=\"flat\" size=\"large\" class=\"px-6\">\r\n        {{ favorites.length }} {{ favorites.length === 1 ? t.favorites?.item : t.favorites?.items }}\r\n      </v-chip>\r\n    </header>\r\n\r\n\r\n    <div v-if=\"!favorites.length\" class=\"text-center py-16\">\r\n      <v-icon icon=\"mdi-heart-outline\" size=\"80\" color=\"grey-lighten-2\" class=\"mb-4\"/>\r\n      <h2 class=\"text-h5 text-medium-emphasis mb-6\">{{ t.favorites?.empty_title }}</h2>\r\n      <v-btn :to=\"`/${locale}`\" color=\"primary\" size=\"large\" rounded=\"pill\" prepend-icon=\"mdi-shopping\">\r\n        {{ t.favorites?.start_shopping }}\r\n      </v-btn>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <v-row>\r\n      <v-col v-for=\"item in favorites\" :key=\"`${item.id}-${item.sku}`\" cols=\"12\" sm=\"6\" md=\"4\" lg=\"3\">\r\n        <v-card class=\"product-card h-100 d-flex flex-column\" rounded=\"xl\" elevation=\"0\">\r\n          <div class=\"image-container overflow-hidden\">\r\n            <v-img :eager=\"false\" :src=\"item.primaryImg\" height=\"240\" cover class=\"product-image\">\r\n              <template #placeholder>\r\n                <v-row class=\"fill-height ma-0\" align=\"center\" justify=\"center\">\r\n                  <v-progress-circular indeterminate color=\"grey-lighten-4\"/>\r\n                </v-row>\r\n              </template>\r\n\r\n              <v-btn\r\n                  icon=\"mdi-close\"\r\n                  variant=\"flat\"\r\n                  color=\"white\"\r\n                  size=\"small\"\r\n                  class=\"remove-btn shadow-sm\"\r\n                  @click=\"removeFavorite(item.id, item.sku)\"\r\n              />\r\n\r\n              <!--                <v-chip v-if=\"item.label\" size=\"x-small\" class=\"ma-3 product-label font-weight-bold\" color=\"primary\" variant=\"flat\">-->\r\n              <!--                  {{ item.label.toUpperCase() }}-->\r\n              <!--                </v-chip>-->\r\n            </v-img>\r\n          </div>\r\n\r\n          <v-card-text class=\"pt-4 pb-2 px-4 flex-grow-1\">\r\n            <div class=\"d-flex justify-space-between align-start mb-1\">\r\n              <span class=\"text-caption font-weight-medium text-disabled\">SKU: {{ item.sku }}</span>\r\n            </div>\r\n            <h3 class=\"text-h6 font-weight-bold text-truncate mb-1\">{{ item.title }}</h3>\r\n            <div class=\"text-h6 color-primary font-weight-black\">\r\n              <span class=\"text-body-2 font-weight-medium\">{{ item.currency }}</span>\r\n              {{ parseFloat(item.price).toLocaleString() }}\r\n            </div>\r\n          </v-card-text>\r\n\r\n          <v-card-actions class=\"pa-4\">\r\n            <v-btn\r\n                block\r\n                color=\"black\"\r\n                variant=\"flat\"\r\n                rounded=\"lg\"\r\n                height=\"44\"\r\n                :to=\"`/${locale}/products/${item.slug}`\"\r\n                class=\"text-none\"\r\n            >\r\n              {{ t.favorites?.view_details }}\r\n            </v-btn>\r\n          </v-card-actions>\r\n        </v-card>\r\n      </v-col>\r\n    </v-row>\r\n\r\n  </v-container>\r\n\r\n  <Render :rows=\"footerData?.data ?? []\" margin-top=\"0px\" is_footer=\"is_footer\" :locale=\"locale\"/>\r\n</template>\r\n\r\n<style scoped>\r\n.shop-page {\r\n  min-height: 70vh;\r\n  background-color: #fcfcfc; /* Extremely light grey for card contrast */\r\n}\r\n\r\n.product-card {\r\n  border: 1px solid #f0f0f0 !important;\r\n  transition: all 0.3s ease;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.product-card:hover {\r\n  transform: translateY(-8px);\r\n  box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08) !important;\r\n  border-color: transparent !important;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.image-container {\r\n  position: relative;\r\n  background-color: #f5f5f5;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.product-image {\r\n  transition: transform 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.product-card:hover .product-image {\r\n  transform: scale(1.08);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.remove-btn {\r\n  position: absolute;\r\n  top: 12px;\r\n  right: 12px;\r\n  opacity: 0;\r\n  transition: opacity 0.2s ease;\r\n  z-index: 2;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.product-card:hover .remove-btn {\r\n  opacity: 1;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.product-label {\r\n  position: absolute;\r\n  bottom: 12px;\r\n  left: 12px;\r\n  z-index: 1;\r\n  letter-spacing: 0.5px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* RTL adjustment for remove button */\r\n[style*=\"direction:rtl\"] .remove-btn {\r\n  left: 12px;\r\n  right: auto;\r\n}\r\n\r\n[style*=\"direction:rtl\"] .product-label {\r\n  right: 12px;\r\n  left: auto;\r\n}\r\n</style>"],"version":3}